      "title": {
        "en": "Gdzie się spotkamy?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "When the plan is made, ask *gdzie się spotkamy?* (where shall we meet?). In a Polish town people often meet *na rynku*, in the main square, *pod pomnikiem* (by the monument). *Kto jeszcze?* is who else, *coś innego* is something else, and *bez dyskusji!* settles it."
      }
    }
